      "originalHash": "f08abb0274e4e49a957059d920dc4fc0ab6dd8f8ca2fd7cf0be3e40d4830f533",
      "sourceFileHash": "5263a8120e1d034ec630bfdf78240c29c1ceaf6a196e4bccead10316db60f39e",
      "originalText": "着替えたアルダンは前へ出て、優雅な立ち姿のまま尋ねる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "eddc05404c0cb39fdf7f105553d2b3f0",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/107100-Mejiro-Ardan/daily-71.kojo",
