      "sourceFileHash": "5263a8120e1d034ec630bfdf78240c29c1ceaf6a196e4bccead10316db60f39e",
      "originalText": "メジロアルダンとの一日の労を終え、メジロアルダンは%YOU%の後ろに回り、ちょうどいい力で%YOU%の肩を揉み始める。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6748d384d732bfa144afb7185e4427c3",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/107100-Mejiro-Ardan/daily-71.kojo",
      "key": "good_night_normal",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "good_night_normal",
        "lines",
        1,
        "lines",
        0,
