      "originalHash": "94b8e95091558d03758f5bff824126e15ec33af20893a728af953e6a8ec48c49",
      "sourceFileHash": "5263a8120e1d034ec630bfdf78240c29c1ceaf6a196e4bccead10316db60f39e",
      "originalText": "ハロウィン当日、%YOU%は事務所でノックを聞き、開けてみると、吸血鬼に扮したアルダンだった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "51e31ba25121d7571061ac07064222ec",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/107100-Mejiro-Ardan/daily-71.kojo",
      "key": "cl_halloween",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
