      "originalHash": "94a36c0e14af6223dcb730092a79dcab91803a5c339bbce0285decb749c75fb2",
      "sourceFileHash": "5263a8120e1d034ec630bfdf78240c29c1ceaf6a196e4bccead10316db60f39e",
      "originalText": "衣装は誘惑と高貴さを少しにじませ、脅かすつもりのかたちが、かえって可愛い。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "9e8d7c7ab34746e5e3189575e21ea619",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/107100-Mejiro-Ardan/daily-71.kojo",
