      "sourceFileHash": "5263a8120e1d034ec630bfdf78240c29c1ceaf6a196e4bccead10316db60f39e",
      "originalText": "「ハッピーハロウィン、アルダン。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d15a75ab4a892d05033ca726410c2a34",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/107100-Mejiro-Ardan/daily-71.kojo",
